{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id34528700"}, "name":{"label":"PeteeRifick"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-21T09:09:38-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.8"}, "id":{"label":"14455383826"}, "title":{"label":"Good but getting slow and bloated"}, "content":{"label":"I was very happy with this app for years but after several upgrades it became unbearably slow (second and a half to start scrolling) and the interface lost coherence. With impending price increases, I'm switching back to Apple's app, which is an interface fiasco but it is free and responsive.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id24945172"}, "name":{"label":"Homagetogorto"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-17T14:11:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.8"}, "id":{"label":"14440276216"}, "title":{"label":"Makes podcasts listenable again"}, "content":{"label":"In hindsight, I should have switched to Overcast when the reel-to-reel tape appeared. But I did switch a few years ago and I’ve been delighted with Overcast. Works seamlessly with private (paid) feeds, intelligently trims out silences, works great with CarPlay, and has advanced settings that you don’t often find in an iOS app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id31880417"}, "name":{"label":"uymai"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-17T04:31:44-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.8"}, "id":{"label":"14438420810"}, "title":{"label":"I’ve got a new favorite podcast app!"}, "content":{"label":"Works just how I think it should work— smart speed trims silences so that you can get through podcasts slightly faster but without making it harder to understand\n\nSide note, a few years later still feel the same— a neat new premium feature is an undo button, so if a podcast plays accidentally for a bit you can see you history and rewind back to where you were\n\n— few years later, updating my review, if you knew me and had a podcast app I would have already told you to use this one  instead", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
