{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id77025096"}, "name":{"label":"saysmoo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-04T15:54:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"14388631063"}, "title":{"label":"Pretty useful on iPhone, not launching on Mac"}, "content":{"label":"UPDATE: At one time, the MacOS app launched and worked ok. Now, with latest releases, it never launches. The window opens, the spinner spins, but the app never completes launch. (Using macOS Tahoe on M2)\n\n+++++\n\nI use this app daily on my phone. It’s always worked fine—there are quirks that annoy, but it gets the job done.\n\nQuirks include:\n• stopping play, removing AirPods and putting those away in case, podcast auto starts playing again, only over the phone speakers.\n• some pinned podcasts sometimes display at the top of the podcast list, and sometimes disappear—no idea why", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id35724160"}, "name":{"label":"Thelaxdude"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-08-02T20:29:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.7.1"}, "id":{"label":"14381140484"}, "title":{"label":"Great"}, "content":{"label":"I consume many podcasts and this is the best way to do it. So glad it will skip the trash people and services inject into feeds.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id1419117584"}, "name":{"label":"Lighthouse1505"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-07-13T17:25:51-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.7"}, "id":{"label":"14300079252"}, "title":{"label":"8 year listener. This app is great"}, "content":{"label":"I listen to a lot of podcasts, I love this app. There are a lot of little settings you can play with to suit your listening tastes, and the feed layout is very intuitive. I particularly like the smart speed feature, which has saved me 430 hours of listening time by just taking out spaces/ pauses between words.\n\nThe developer is always adding new features and tweaks to make the app better. I like the autogenerated transcripts so I can seek to a moment im looking for.\n\nHighly recommend this app for podcast enthusiasts, of for people fed up with loud, annoying, unskippable Spotify pre-roll adds (for a service that you pay for). Overcast is so much better", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
