{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id110461413"}, "name":{"label":"Pistol Pete mebo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-14T10:23:27-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14064258467"}, "title":{"label":"Choppy audio"}, "content":{"label":"This app has worked fine for a few years but now the audio is consistently choppy. I deleted the app and reinstalled, made sure there was plenty of space in my phone and this problem persists. Don’t know why the devs took an app that worked fine and added bugs. I hate having to switch apps but I think I’ve got to with this choppy audio.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id303847584"}, "name":{"label":"Sum boOoOodiee!"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-11T07:32:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"2025.8.1"}, "id":{"label":"14052817255"}, "title":{"label":"Good, but surpassed by another app."}, "content":{"label":"Used this for almost 10 years, but now there is another app that has smart speed and volume boost. The new app doesn’t cap file size at 1 gb, has no 10 gb total cap, and lets you play files locally off your phone. Having to edit and split audiobooks with audacity to be under a gig and constantly juggle and upload and delete to be under the 10 gb cap took like 2-3 hours of work per week, and now I don’t have to do that. For now I’m canceling my long held subscription. Thank you smart speed for saving me 2650 hours, but I have found another. If file size is increased to 5 gb and total size is increased to 100 gb, or if I can just play stuff right off my phone without limits, I might come back.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id22387366"}, "name":{"label":"yub1970"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-05-05T15:26:56-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14032422755"}, "title":{"label":"transcripts!!!"}, "content":{"label":"The new transcripts feature is just fantastic.\nNow that I’m listening and seeing the transcript synced, the little music symbols during outros/intros, it’s just brilliant, and it does draw me in deeper into what they’re saying. And a noisy places it’s so helpful. Congratulations  !!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/reviews/id11026352"}, "name":{"label":"Zoltok"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-04-29T08:26:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"2026.4.1"}, "id":{"label":"14009605300"}, "title":{"label":"Unstable and aggravating"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Overcast for years, but the latest updates combined with the IOS updates have left the app in a terrible state. It crashes if paused for more than a few minutes, or when loading other apps. When it does, it resets the episode back to the beginning and requires you to manually find your place again. It doesn’t work well with the IOS audio player while locked, so you have to be constantly watching it for issues, which is the exact opposite of what I want in a podcast player. Recommend people use literally any other player instead.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/ca/review?id=888422857&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
